    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="EulerTop is a torque-free rigid body: Euler&#x27;s equations for the body-frame angular velocity \boldsymbol\omega = (\omega_1, \omega_2, \omega_3) about the three principal axes, with moments of inertia I_1, I_2, I_3,">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/classical/rotations/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_dzhanibekov_thumb.png
