.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="A rattleback (Celt stone) spins smoothly forever in one sense, but spun the other way it soon wobbles, stalls, and reverses into the stable sense of spin. Rattleback is a deliberately simplified toy model built directly on EulerTop&#x27;s free-rigid-body equations, for a reduced state (n_1, n_2, n_3) (n_3 playing the role of spin about the roughly-vertical axis, n_1, n_2 the two rocking/tipping-mode rates):">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/classical/rotations/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_05_rattleback_thumb.gif
